MIT License (code) — see below.

The Malrule benchmark data in `data/raw_data.csv` and `data/oss120b_v3.csv`
is instantiated from MalruleLib (https://github.com/luffycodes/malrulelib),
which is distributed under a non-commercial license. Any downstream use of
that portion is subject to MalruleLib's license.

The EEDI data in `data/eedi/` is derived from the publicly released EEDI
diagnostic-questions dataset; downstream use should follow the source
license.

Trained model checkpoints (produced by scripts/02_train_sft.sh and
scripts/03_train_grpo.sh) inherit their base models' licenses:
Qwen3-family (Apache 2.0), Llama-3-family (Meta Llama license),
gpt-oss (Apache 2.0).

